# Crossweb capability grants.
# The host loads this file from the process working directory at startup.
# One plugin.command per line. Commands that are not listed are denied.
# A line whose first character is # is a comment. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Granted commands are not sandboxed. fs.read and fs.write can reach any path
# the OS user can access. keystore commands handle secrets. Uncomment a line
# only when this app's own UI is the caller you intend to trust.
#
# fs.read
# fs.write
# keystore.encrypt
# keystore.decrypt
# keystore.save
# keystore.load
# keystore.get
